# UI Conventions

## Color System — Single Source of Truth

All colors live in `frontend/src/app/globals.css` as CSS custom properties.
**Never write hex, rgba, or named colors in component files, `constants.ts`, or anywhere else.**

Light (`:root`) and dark (`html[data-theme="dark"]` + `prefers-color-scheme: dark`) share the same
primary / on-blue / semantic / material tokens. Surfaces, text, borders, and overlays invert.

The resolved theme is `html[data-theme="light"|"dark"]`. Preference (`system` | `light` | `dark`)
is stored at `localStorage['compas-color-theme']` (written immediately on change; also persisted
in `uiStore.colorTheme`). A blocking script in `layout.tsx` applies it before first paint.
This is **independent** of Speckle viewmode (`viewMode: 'dark'` = Sounds lighting).

