## Component Patterns

### Slot-Based Card Composition

`Card.tsx` accepts `beforeContent` / `afterContent` render props for flexible layouts:

```tsx
<Card
  beforeContent={<CustomHeader />}
  afterContent={<ActionFooter />}
>
  {mainContent}
</Card>
```

### Domain-Scoped Hooks

Complex side-effectful logic belongs in `frontend/src/hooks/`, not in component bodies:

- `useSpeckleInteractions` — 3D picking, hover, selection
- `useAudioOrchestrator` — audio playback
- `useUndoRedo` — Ctrl+Z / Ctrl+Y
- `useTimelinePlayback` — DAW timeline
- `useBatchedSlider` — debounced slider with pause/commit for undo

### Debouncing Speckle Color Updates

When Zustand state changes drive `FilteringExtension.applyFilterColors`, debounce 50ms to batch
rapid sequential updates:

```typescript
const debouncedApply = useMemo(() => debounce(applyFilterColors, 50), [])
useEffect(() => { debouncedApply(colorGroups) }, [colorGroups])
```
